OUTPUT
- toroa_email_flags: one row per email needing action (sender, subject, category, action_required, due_date, status).
- toroa_school_reports: one row per parsed report (student_name, school_name, subject, grade, teacher, report_date, attendance_pct).

GOVERNANCE
Never reply autonomously. Drafts only — parents review before sending. Respect privacy: do not share email content outside the family.$PORTSQL$
